WEBVTT

00:10:56.860 --> 00:11:01.615
not an extractive view of nature,
but a regenerative view of nature.

00:11:01.615 --> 00:11:03.367
And I'm going to show you how.

00:11:03.367 --> 00:11:04.618
I'm going to show you how.

00:11:06.829 --> 00:11:10.499
Gabon has 57,000 elephants.

00:11:11.709 --> 00:11:15.963
If you leave them alone,
they can grow to 195,000 elephants.

00:11:16.797 --> 00:11:21.427
Gabon can sell the carbon offsets
of its elephants.

00:11:21.468 --> 00:11:25.305
Imagine -- because those elephants
are grabbing carbon in the trees --

00:11:25.347 --> 00:11:29.226
they can sell the carbon offsets
of their elephants.

00:11:29.226 --> 00:11:30.936
To whom?